<a id="hello"></a>
## Hello

Example input:

```yaml
on: push
jobs:
  test:
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
    steps:
      - run: echo ${{ unknown }}
permissions: {}
```

Output:

```console
test.yaml:6:23: unknown-variable: undefined variable "unknown". available variables are "env", "github", "inputs", "job", "matrix", "needs", "runner", "secrets", "steps", "strategy", "vars" [expression-reference]
  |
6 |       - run: echo ${{ unknown }}
  |                       ^~~~~~~
```

[Playground](https://kjanat.github.io/actionlint/#eNokyr0NwzAMROFeU1yRVgtwmzggYOeHFHwkUgjaPWBcveJ7boKR3NvTN0oDQhlV4ExjL88tLbK/72V/YujgdQG9ToE+dsdtTqS9zL+GtdrQ83OQhxsFc/0GAE0uIzU=)

The output code block carries a language identifier.
